==English==

===Etymology===
From Greek δενδρίτης ''dendrites'' "of or pertaining to a tree".

===Noun===
'''dendrite''' (''plural'' '''dendrites''')
# {{cytology}} A slender projection of a [[nerve cell]] which conducts [[nerve impulse]]s from a [[synapse]] to the body of the cell; a [[dendron]].


